data: {"id": "bd7a8f5670f94660-thinking-parallel_evidence-1225", "run_id": "bd7a8f5670f94660", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "# 证据结论\n\n## 已确认事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`Pending`（kube-state-metrics 的 `kube_pod_status_phase=Pending`），容器 `app` 处于 `ContainerCreating`，从未进入 Running。重启计数为 0。\n\n2. **Events 核心错误**（关键证据）：\n   - `FailedMount`（重复 x60，持续 109 分钟）：`MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - `FailedMount`（重复 x45，持续 107 分钟）：`Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition`\n\n3. **Pod Spec 验证**：`kubectl_get_yaml` 确认 Pod 的 volumes 中定", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789051551697, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

